association":"CONTRIBUTOR","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/847#pullrequestreview-1133971017"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/847"}},"submitted_at":"2022-10-07T06:42:42Z","commit_id":"88086c55018152140db9a53d801e9d8699ecc1d4"},{"id":1133983946,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOEFLz885DlzjK","user":{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I think this looks like sensible work on this feature, I have not worked too much on the ACLs and our coverage of the feature and unit tests are good, but it suffers from the problem of testing \"our interpretation\" of how it should work.\r\n\r\nMy main concern with this is that if we get it wrong, and users start relying on that, we have a hard time fixing it. With things like SSH, the worst possible scenario is that someone lock themselves out from a machine.\r\n\r\nAs mentioned in Discord, integration tests would make a lot of sense for this feature, so we have the opportunity to actually verify that the client does what we expect and intend. I am not sure if Tailscale SSH will play nicely in Docker, but I think it is worth a shot.\r\n\r\nI don't _want_ to block this feature, the question is, how should we roll it out to minimise the impact if we get something wrong? (This hesitant approach comes from the Namespace/User/Tailnet issue we had earlier)","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/847#pullrequestreview-1133983946","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/847","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/847#pullrequestreview-1133983946"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/847"}},"submitted_at":"2022-10-07T06:56:33Z","commit_id":"88086c55018152140db9a53d801e9d8699ecc1d4"},{"id":1194545271,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOEFLz885HM1B3","user":{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/847#pullrequestreview-1194545271","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/847","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","_links":{